# Handler return types

Handlers return generated contract responses.

```csharp
public record CreatePageCommand(CreatePageRequest Request)
    : IRequest<CreatePageResponse>;

public class CreatePageHandler(AppDbContext context, IMapper mapper)
    : IRequestHandler<CreatePageCommand, CreatePageResponse>
{
}
```
